    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Seasons and weather",
     "texto": [
      "To say «in spring», «in summer», «in autumn» and «in winter», we use **wiosną**, **latem**, **jesienią** and **zimą**. They are instrumental forms used as adverbs.",
      "They are adverb forms: one Polish word does the work of «in spring»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Favourite» agrees",
     "texto": [
      "**Ulubiona pora roku** means «favourite season».",
      "**Ulubiona** agrees with **pora**, which is feminine."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
